> look
Living Room
This is the living room. There is a door to the east. To the west is a wooden door with strange gothic lettering, which appears to be nailed shut. A trophy case takes up one corner of the room. A large oriental rug lies to one side of the room, moved away from the trap door it once covered.

You can see a guidebook, a matchbook, a wrench, a screwdriver, a trunk, a hand pump, a skeleton key, an incense, and a large brochure here.

In the trophy case you see a portrait, a painting, a stack of zorkmid bills, a platinum bar, a Don Woods stamp, and a gold coffin.

> inventory
You are carrying:

an ivory torch, brass lantern

